cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HarvestGuard-PK: District-Crop Yield Shock Forecasting Benchmark"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
authors:
  - name: "Masmatix Innovations Research"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MHKhan50/harvestguard-pk-v0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, leakage-safe benchmark for one-year-ahead district-crop yield
  forecasting and yield-shock alert evaluation using Pakistan Bureau of Statistics
  aggregate crop statistics. The repository includes a synthetic smoke-test panel;
  it does not bundle or claim synthetic observations as official data.
keywords:
  - Pakistan
  - crop yield
  - food security
  - forecasting
  - conformal prediction
